{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Mommy-to-Be Pregnancy Tracker 是一款為準媽媽而設的孕期記錄應用，以每週為單位追蹤胎兒發育，並可計算胎動、記錄產檢與撰寫孕期日誌。所有資料只存放在裝置上，無需註冊帳戶，重視私隱的孕婦亦可安心使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>孕期追蹤與胎動記錄一應俱全</h2>\n<p>應用提供每週孕期追蹤，同步顯示胎兒大小變化，讓準媽媽掌握發育進度。內置胎動計數器與胎動記錄，方便觀察寶寶活動；產檢行事曆可整理各項檢查時間。孕期日誌支援相片與文字筆記，記下每個重要時刻。另備營養建議與孕期指引，並以離線優先設計，資料只留在裝置之中。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-144-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-145-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-146-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-147-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-148-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mommy-to-Be Pregnancy Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T22:58:42.659986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}